rol\nAnimal Shelter\nDispatch\nEmergency Services\nSilent Observer\nParks &\nRecreation\nPArk Services\nIntroduction\nParks Commission\nPark Reservations\nRates & Fees\nFrequently Asked Questions\nPark Events\nIntroduction\nParks Commission\nPark Reservations\nRates & Fees\nFrequently Asked Questions\nPark Events\nCounty Parks\nDiamond Lake County Park\nEd Henning County Park\nHardy Dam County Marina\nJohn Graves Lodge\nSandy Beach County Park\nMichigan’s Dragon at Hardy Dam\nWhite Cloud County Park\nDiamond Lake County Park\nEd Henning County Park\nHardy Dam County Marina\nJohn Graves Lodge\nSandy Beach County Park\nMichigan’s Dragon at Hardy Dam\nWhite Cloud County Park\nQuick Access\nCounty Jail\nCircuit Court\nDistrict Court\nProbate Court\nFriend of the Court\nCounty Jail\nCircuit Court\nDistrict Court\nProbate Court\nFriend of the Court\nSearch\nRegister of Deeds\nHome\n/\nRegister of Deeds\n/\nRegister of Deeds\nStewart K. Sanders\nRegister of Deeds\nContact\n1087 Newell St, PO Box 885\nWhite Cloud, MI 49349\nM-F, 8 AM – 5 PM\n(231) 689-7246\n(231) 689-7271\nRegister of Deeds\nAdditional Resources\nRegister of Deeds Overview\nPlat Board\nPassports\nE-Recording\nDocument Searches\nPlat Books\nFrequently Asked Questions\nDocument Recording\nReal Estate Transfer Tax\nFraud Alert Signup\nA Note From Stewart ...\nIn better serving the public, our office is open Monday – Friday,\n(with the exception of Newaygo County recognized holidays).\nDocuments can be registered/recorded until 4:00pm.\nU.S. Passport Application process is available until 4:00pm.\nIndependent* Document Search is accessible in our office from 9:00am to 4:00pm Tuesday, Wednesday & Thursdays. * Staff is Not able to assist in Document Searching.\nWhen mailing in documents to be registered/recorded, please remember to mail to: Register of Deeds – P.O. Box 885 , White Cloud, MI 49349.\nA self-addressed and stamped envelope is requested to be included along with your document(s) and fee payment. This 